OL,3,GNEWSANew body will look at case for
OL,4,AWelsh independence, and more devolution
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case for Welsh independence, as
OL,7,Fwell as more devolution for Cardiff
OL,8,FBay, will be considered by a new body
OL,9,Fset-up by the Plaid Cymru Welsh
OL,10,Fgovernment.
OL,12,FA National Commission for Wales will
OL,13,Fprovide "advice, evidence and analysis"
OL,14,Fon the country's constitutional future,
OL,15,Fthe Cardiff administration said.
OL,17,FThe minister in charge announced on
OL,18,FTuesday it will be led by two chairs -
OL,19,Fa former ambassador to France and an
OL,20,Facademic expert on constitutional law.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
